      <activity id="f982a6e5-7084-5602-a2cd-718aebc49ea4" activityNameId="d2fc8b10-525f-5aa3-b5eb-2e7717628f5b" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Zinc oxide, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Zinc oxide, at plant
The functional unit represent 1 kg of solid zinc oxide powder. Large uncertainty of the process data due to weak data on the production process and missing data on process emissions.;
CAS number: 001314-13-2; 
Formula: ZnO; 
Synonyms: zinc white; 
UUID: 1663ffbe-5722-3413-b13b-23c44323dabf
Raw materials and chemicals used for production, transport of materials to manufacturing plant, estimated emissions to air and water from production (incomplete), estimation of energy demand and infrastructure of the plant (approximation). Solid wastes omitted.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Production out of secondary zinc materials by mean of the indirect (or French) way. The emissions to air (1 wt.% of raw material input) and water were estimated using mass balance.
Time period: data of published literature
Production volume: na
Sampling: Process data based on few literature sources. Energy demand based on approximation from large chemical plant. Process emissions based on estimations only. 
Extrapolations: see generalComment
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_1663ffbe-5722-3413-b13b-23c44323dabf.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
